      "image": "assets/artists/rave-saint.jpg",
      "about": [
        "Rave Saint is the techno project of Dominik, whose music started early: music school as a kid, trumpet in school bands, then writing and rapping as Q-Dom, both solo and as one half of the duo Colorz. Through his architecture studies he moved into design and software development, branding well-known names in the Slovenian music scene while his own music waited.",
        "Once his business was on solid ground, he found his way back through the rave scene, first as a fan. He picked up Ableton, used the pandemic years to teach himself production, and built up a backlog of demos. The turning point came at EXIT festival 2022, where he proposed to his girlfriend during the last minute of Boris Brejcha's set. The moment went viral, and that season became his debut single, Rave Saint, featuring her vocals and released in December 2022."
      ],
